  "analysis": "Cache modifiers make no difference — the norm kernel is at ~198µs across all configs, matching the copy ceiling (190µs). The stats kernel (100µs) is at the read ceiling (99µs). End-to-end we're at 292µs vs a hardware floor of ~290µs. The GPU work is saturated; no further meaningful gains available. Current official score: 27.64x speedup with 5/5 correctness. I'll do a final validation run mimicking the final verification (100 perf trials) to confirm stability.",
